      526.84,
      538.37,
      583.15
    ],
    "text": "Showers or thundershowers will occur at times in Western, Sabaragamuwa and North-western provinces and in Galle, Matara, Kandy and Nuwara-Eliya districts. Heavy falls about 100 mm are likely at some places in these areas.",
